Added the public :class:`~icalendar.enums.ACTION` string enum for RFC 5545 alarm actions. ``Alarm.new()``, ``Alarm.new_display()``, ``Alarm.new_audio()``, and ``Alarm.new_email()`` now use the enum values in their type hints and construction paths while preserving string compatibility. OpenAI Codex (GPT-5) assisted with interpreting review feedback and updating this entry; the final change was manually verified. @1cbyc
